Package: memries
Version: {{VERSION}}
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: {{ARCH}}
Depends: libvips42t64, ffmpeg, passwd, systemd
Recommends: nginx | apache2
Maintainer: Memries <memries@localhost>
Installed-Size: {{SIZE}}
Description: Self-hosted photo and video library
 A date-scrolling timeline for a photo library kept on your own machine.
 Originals stay where they are; thumbnails are generated once.
 .
 This package installs the API server as a systemd service listening on
 127.0.0.1:5987, the built web interface in /usr/share/memries/www, and
 example configuration for nginx and Apache. The web server serves the
 interface and proxies /api and /auth to the service: the two must share an
 origin, because the session cookie is SameSite=Lax.
 .
 Configuration is one file, /etc/memries/config.yaml.
